{"body":{"path":"research/cases/b-short-drama-observation-20261017/revisions/short-drama-20261017-v1-0/research.md","sha256":"dc4790eaba67a0024b8cbfb6213c85f8b73c91b241b3c27c237493e0d7d19ec9","size":32721},"human_acceptance":"not-confirmed","input":{"case_id":"b-short-drama-observation-20261017","kind":"quick","mandate":"用户沿Decision-OS-2 #7收口，在2026-10-17T17:32:15+08:00提供B真实观察：“身边看短剧的人越来越多了，基本上我身边所有的人都在看短剧，甚至打车的时候还有很多师傅在边开车边看短剧”。实际观察起点、城市、样本人数、平台和是否付费未知；来源性质为用户对熟人及打车接触司机的非随机生活观察，不能外推全国比例或把行车观看视为正面商业指标。本次委托在现役Quick中把观察转为可检验问题，研究国内微短剧使用、变现、产业利益分配及最多3个有一手披露上市主体的经济归属反证，完成有界查证/挑战/正常保管与恢复。海外仅在核发行人收益归属时分开；不自动升级Full、不作买入建议或通知。公开仅去标识化的必要观察、原创成果和有权保存的事实摘录；无个人识别信息、其他私人聊天、第三方全文/供应商原行或正式Decision。原输入时刻不当作观察开始或来源披露时刻；本案是B，不冒充G自主发现。","method":"decision-os-research-quick-v1@sha256:c2186dad0da13b8ea6fac3195640991c4b2fbf5c3dc284655dd39d176d45b764","predecessor":null,"revision_id":"short-drama-20261017-v1-0","sources":[{"manifest":{"commit":"4b1add08fd9efd3718839637105dc8c88b9365ec","path":"source-views/b7-cnnic55-20261017/77194a6f0dacdec212eceebb18d062affc8ef7bdcc091f68af51a80e90ca6f43/manifest.json","repository":"auguspp/Decision-OS-2","sha256":"6e15ca27f34fe87cab7856c9c583cfa43675feef0bed4ea3c4cb0b35671d5048"},"selection":{"columns":[],"end":null,"kind":"all","start":null}},{"manifest":{"commit":"9a06094ef54ce10106adaffaabaaa655a9def6cc","path":"source-views/b7-cnnic57-20261017/fbf1049df65c0c66a217f19ca49a7f7d88a3b6ca1b71017552540689674f3048/manifest.json","repository":"auguspp/Decision-OS-2","sha256":"ab2e729f9e77504170d4e6cefd1298739d58cfc5f4c01a85f44cde0270c93630"},"selection":{"columns":[],"end":null,"kind":"all","start":null}},{"manifest":{"commit":"9c655034b5fd8ba6754b91b44308a95a9c1df9d7","path":"source-views/b7-cnsa-whitepaper-2025-20261017/e25532f4ff672ef396a9ec3bd7e94e4388d0deafbe7376069fc50467c5d6f9ab/manifest.json","repository":"auguspp/Decision-OS-2","sha256":"4d33eaeb632f59f220d43de4e702c5995931e53a90ea1e71614c70fdc4ffc483"},"selection":{"columns":[],"end":null,"kind":"